// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P297138413" "Incoming!"
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3944973876" "The rescue squad has arrived."
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2505306398" "Fools. They think to defeat me?"
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2164774884" "The heroes are coming."
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P658815986" "My senses detect the enemy."
// MUGGING_MUSCLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1445378155" "It is time for battle."

// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1383942110" "Get the hero!"
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3719093723" "Don't run."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3315750876" "Stand and fight."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3853418900" "We have the advantage."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2412985502" "We can defeat them."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4115227842" "I will best this weakling."
