"P2704481073" "Time for good fight."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1721015473" "You have no chance."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4002335398" "I will put you down quickly."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2617252660" "Good, I prefer a stand up fight."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P745661809" "I will run no longer."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P192491368" "To battle!"
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3680968069" "You will learn to respect the Warriors."

// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1765540413" "Thank you for helping me."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1178250633" "Thank you ever so much."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1629688444" "How can I ever repay you?"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
