// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P4083570809" "I'm very grateful."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P92001444" "I am so glad you came along."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P3079037571" "Paragon City needs more heroes like you."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P2038176433" "I can't wait to tell my friends about this."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P2911253003" "This is the most exciting thing that has ever happened to me."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P4262979657" "You are my new favorite hero."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P522724726" "Maybe I was wrong about capes."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
