"P4213246058" "Nice costume."

// VANDALISM_VANDAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3277131225" "Violence may be crude, but it can be so gratifying."
// VANDALISM_VANDAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3221101295" "This place is mine to destroy!"
// VANDALISM_VANDAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
