// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P976362612" "Now apply what we have learned."
// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1251836609" "Be victorious."
// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3749524630" "A hero. How opportune."
// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1561439558" "Make me proud."
// FIGHTCLUB_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3822133984" "Fight well, and you shall be rewarded."

// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P960327738" "You are no match for my skills."
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P543445827" "You will certainly fall before me."
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P236737952" "Your skills cannot compete with mine."
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P791565532" "You are too weak to stand before me."
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P653863728" "You are not worthy to do battle with a Warrior."

// SHADYDEAL_BAGMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P628596171" "I have the best wares right here."
// SHADYDEAL_BAGMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P987341308" "Anything you need, just ask."
// SHADYDEAL_BAGMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2319065141" "I can give you a good deal."

// SHADYDEAL_BAGMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3109353629" "I don't do business with masks!"
// SHADYDEAL_BAGMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2528942746" "How dare you interrupt!"
// SHADYDEAL_BAGMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1832462713" "I won't go down for stolen goods!"

// SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3955695262" "I'm looking for something very unique."
// SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P408793631" "Just the usual."
// SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2214209399" "What can you give me in trade?"

// SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P198088288" "You masks think you're something special?"
// SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P755085002" "You don't belong in our territory!"
// SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4204249564" "We'll show you who runs the streets around here!"

// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P958483896" "I see nothing."
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3584777737" "Nothing on the horizon."
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2051234645" "I'll keep watch."
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P548633505" "I'll let you know if I spot anything."
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3634841888" "Hurry, while the skies are clear."
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2902282072" "These artifacts need to make it to Frostfire, or there'll be trouble."
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1647240632" "We've got a volatile cargo of artifacts. Nothing had better go wrong."
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1362023515" "Odysseus won't be happy if we're ambushed again."

// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3606093215" "Warriors, attack!"
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1804663329" "Enemies are near!"
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1554732910" "Defeat the heroes!"
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2652348555" "Defend the shipment!"

// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1541446547" "The Council must pay for their transgressions."
// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1914250371" "We will eliminate these Council snakes."
// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1986547980" "The Council will not forget this day."
// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2846432107" "The Family has offended Odysseus for the last time."

// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P743132657" "You shouldn't have seen that!"
// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3691445589" "I'm going to have to destroy you."
// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2518619153" "Fight me!"
// STRIGA_BOMBSETUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P759804813" "Are you ready to battle a Warrior?"

// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P481192337" "You don't belong here!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P223711243" "This place is ours!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P83400647" "The Warriors will never back down to you!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1591712855" "You cannot break the spirit of a true Warrior."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2211577878" "Try as you might, you will never own Striga."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2929996486" "The Warriors are here to stay!"

// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P430513521" "This is our fight!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3521727359" "We can fight our own battles."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P508474179" "How dare you interrupt us?"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3542145404" "This war is ours. You have no part in it."

// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P824345950" "You will not soon forget this lesson."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3628303821" "Remember our strength!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1976017358" "Do not come here again!"

// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3856050428" "You, too, will be eliminated."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2124435957" "Striga has no use for heroes."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2211518188" "You are not strong enough to stand against the Warriors."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1614544557" "We will crush you, as certainly as we will crush the Council!"

// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2276981610" "These artifacts are priceless."
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1921798136" "Careful. I hear there's a real Ming vase in here."
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P565265302" "Someone told me these artifacts are cursed."
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2655334628" "Anyone know what's in here? Odysseus won't say."

// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P7489544" "Keep back!"
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2061862284" "You cannot best a Warrior in combat!"
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3768455923" "You will not steal from the Warriors!"
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2377603434" "Odysseus will not forgive this transgression."

// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_WARRIORSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3030779944" "Make no mistake. If we meet again, I will kill you."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_WARRIORSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1753128260" "The Warriors are not your friends. Never forget this."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_WARRIORSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1804290155" "This one deal, I will make. But no others."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_WARRIORSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4096738058" "This is business. This is not an alliance."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_WARRIORSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P697196722" "Your money buys you a moment of my time, but no more."

// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_WARRIORSELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P91578727" "You shouldn't interfere!"
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_WARRIORSELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3516265973" "I will deal with this intruder."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_WARRIORSELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1601914489" "Test your mettle against mine!"

// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_COUNCILBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3554136112" "As long as you deliver, I don't really care."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_COUNCILBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1849909282" "Don't kid yourself, Warrior. You're as greedy as anyone else on this island."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_COUNCILBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3004386457" "Let's make this deal fast."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_COUNCILBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3754009760" "I'm not offering friendship, just some quick cash."

// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3814296762" "Yeah, yeah, yeah. You got the goods or what?"
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1490565106" "Look, I don't have all day. Cough up the loot."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3472643020" "All right, already. Let's have the stuff."
// STRIGA_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2511162734" "You gonna talk all day, or are we gonna make a deal?"

// STRIGA_RAVE_WANNABEE_RUNAWAY_TEXT :
"P4146514000" "I gotta get out of here!"
// STRIGA_RAVE_WANNABEE_RUNAWAY_TEXT :
"P3979817551" "I can't get arrested again!"
// STRIGA_RAVE_WANNABEE_RUNAWAY_TEXT :
"P430002665" "I'll run for help."
// STRIGA_RAVE_WANNABEE_RUNAWAY_TEXT :
"P2350962148" "I am so gone."
// STRIGA_RAVE_WANNABEE_RUNAWAY_TEXT :
"P380311007" "Sorry, guys, but I can't take another night in the Zig."

// STRIGA_RAVE_DANCER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3473557632" "We are Warriors!"
// STRIGA_RAVE_DANCER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3850503588" "We are mighty!"
// STRIGA_RAVE_DANCER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1151759647" "Our deeds are legend!"
// STRIGA_RAVE_DANCER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2862472626" "Our enemies tremble!"

// STRIGA_RAVE_DANCER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4005131068" "You would challenge us here?"
// STRIGA_RAVE_DANCER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3803220236" "Warriors! Battle calls!"
// STRIGA_RAVE_DANCER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3582314532" "Ah, a fight. A perfect end to the party."

// STRIGA_RAVE_GROUPIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2223981513" "Oh, gosh."
// STRIGA_RAVE_GROUPIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P943744927" "You guys are so strong."
// STRIGA_RAVE_GROUPIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P152964942" "Isn't someone gonna kiss me?"
// STRIGA_RAVE_GROUPIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P222471660" "You boys are amazing!"
// STRIGA_RAVE_GROUPIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1971568122" "Wow! Talk about good dancing!"

// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P547241291" "I'm definitely hearing something."
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2185024550" "Stand by. I think I have something."
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1265332866" "I know someone's there."

// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4029730300" "I need no backup to deal with you."
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3214410279" "I will report back when you are lying in the dust."
// STRIGA_WARRIORS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
